    // 'instagram-post' preset. Identical pixels (the preset IS 1080x1080), but
    // the API's layout linter only knows the canvas size when resolution is
    // 'custom' — with a preset it cannot tell that the full-bleed background
    // SVG is a background, and reports every foreground element that declares
    // both a width and a height as "overlapping" it. Declaring the canvas gives
